Soigneur Studio
Indoor cycling and training, on your own server.

Soigneur Studio is based on Auuki by Dimitar Marinov (dvmarinoff):
https://github.com/dvmarinoff/Auuki, licensed under the GNU Affero General
Public License, version 3 (AGPL-3.0). It was imported from Auuki in November
2026 and has been developed separately since; it is not made or supported by
the Auuki project.

Parts that come from Auuki, largely unchanged: the trainer and sensor engine
(src/ble, src/ant), the FIT file format (src/fit), the data models and
storage (src/models, src/storage, src/db.js) and parts of the views and the
workout library. Parts written for Soigneur Studio: the interface and design
system (src/css, the pages and src/views/training), the Training page and its
logic (src/training), the account server (server/) and its connections to
Strava, intervals.icu and Garmin.

The whole program, including the changes, is licensed under the AGPL-3.0
(see LICENSE.txt). If you run a modified version on a server that others use
over a network, offer them its source code (AGPL-3.0, section 13).

"Auuki" is the name of the original project; Soigneur Studio uses it only to
credit its origin.
